  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of JanusRequest library:\n\t\t\t- HTTP API client with fluent interface\n\t\t\t- Automatic serialization (JSON, XML, Form Data, Form URL-Encoded)\n\t\t\t- Advanced error handling and automatic recovery\n\t\t\t- Authentication support (Basic, Bearer, API Key)\n\t\t\t- Throttling and rate limiting management\n\t\t\t- Attribute-based request configuration\n\t\t\t- Synchronous and asynchronous extensions",
